	(text "Gate capacitance is ~7nF, Gate resistance is ~1.7Ohms\nt = 1.7*7*10^-9\nt = ~1.19ns\n4RC takes about 48ns, simulation shows ~200ns\nThis results in ~5MHz capable switching.\nWe aim to use ~50-100KHz PWM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.748 89.916 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "11048e2b-a1f6-446a-ac6a-ec030654e629")
	)
	(text "Need to evaluate inductive kickback better.\nCurrent diode selected has a zener voltage of 28.9, while the fets Vdsmax is 30.\nBetter component selection or motor driver circuit might be required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.002 20.828 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 132 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "48d68440-654d-4689-ba97-3d5dd3be8286")
	)
	(text "HSD could be safer, but PMOS have higher Rds-on. \nLSD is more power efficient but requires your load to always be supplied by Vdd.\n\nCould do H-Bridge"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 145.542 -6.604 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "55549042-90b9-407e-bbd3-b35da5c29e22")
	)
	(text "Pull down resistors for fet gate\nProbably not required with the BJTs,\nbut it doesnt hurt."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.136 67.818 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "66ef534d-9a95-48f5-9d5f-7fa4f210749f")
	)
	(text "MOSFET Low Side Drives\n"
